STATE_HVG_plus_progeny_3066 — 3,066 genes
==========================================
Built from STATE_HVG.txt (2,000) ∪ progeny_top100_genes_resolved1287.txt (1,287).
The PROGENy list is the top 100 genes per pathway by p-value over the whole human
model (OmniPath annotations, resource PROGENy, license=academic; the default
commercial view is truncated), 14 pathways: 1,400 memberships, 1,297 distinct genes.
